id nlp-plus-plus
name NLP++
appeared 1998
creators Amnon Meyers and David de Hilster
tags pl
website https://visualtext.org/nlp/
description A programming language for natural language processing. An NLP++ analyzer is a sequence of passes; each pass matches pattern rules against a shared parse tree and runs C++-like code when a rule fires, with a hierarchical knowledge base (Conceptual Grammar) built into the language.
writtenIn cpp
fileType text
fileExtensions nlp pat
country United States

lineCommentToken #
multiLineCommentTokens /* */
hasComments true
hasLineComments true
 # A comment
hasMultiLineComments true
 /* A comment
 */
hasSemanticIndentation false

example
 @POST
 S("value") = num(N("value",1)) * num(N("numeric",2));
 single();

 @RULES
 _money <-
     _money          ### (1)
     _number         ### (2)
     _currency [opt] ### (3)
     @@

githubRepo https://github.com/VisualText/nlp-engine
rosettaCode https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Category:NLP%2B%2B
languageServerProtocolProject https://github.com/VisualText/vscode-nlp
reference https://book.visualtext.org
reference https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/2227/
